				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">incessus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. Met. 2, p. 115, 25</span></i>
			.—<i>Adv.</i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">immĕdĭtātē</span></b> , <i>without premeditation</i>, Gell. praef. §
			10.</div>
